{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About This Demo</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Adventures of TED and the Lost Magic Crystals Demo is a cozy 2.5D platformer adventure that gives players a sneak peek into TED\u2019s journey to save the squirrel kingdom. In this demo, you can experience the beginning of TED\u2019s quest through three exciting levels filled with puzzles, enemies, and platforming challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Included in This Demo:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 playable levels from the full version</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration, movement, and combat mechanics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden items to find</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller support (Xbox &amp; PlayStation)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo is designed to give you a taste of the world, gameplay, and style of the full game. Your progress will not carry over to the full version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RgamesID invites you to enjoy a nostalgic adventure inspired by classic 2.5D low-poly platformers from the golden age of console gaming!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4125370?t=1762676584","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4125370?t=1762676584","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125370/b7fb0abe7e3bb1c160c6edd69a8b74a0ea3edbd3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762676584","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125370/b7fb0abe7e3bb1c160c6edd69a8b74a0ea3edbd3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762676584","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"